{"id":"627867","name":"凉拌牛肉","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/627867/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"280g"}],"sub":[{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"250g"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"1/4个"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"大蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小米辣","amount":"1个"},{"name":"干辣椒","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"辅料洗净沥干。","img":"images/627867/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"牛肉切片。","img":"images/627867/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入牛肉腌料腌二十分钟。","img":"images/627867/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"辅料改刀。","img":"images/627867/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"黄瓜洋葱香菜小米辣干辣椒放入碗底。","img":"images/627867/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"凉拌调料混合均匀备用。","img":"images/627867/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中烧开水。","img":"images/627867/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"腌好的牛肉放入沸水中煮，水开一分钟捞出。","img":"images/627867/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放凉。","img":"images/627867/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"烧热油，倒入配菜碗中。","img":"images/627867/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"再放牛肉片。","img":"images/627867/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"倒入凉拌调料。","img":"images/627867/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"搅拌均匀，静置十分钟入味，开吃。","img":"images/627867/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}